			&amp;lt;p class="flavor"&amp;gt;Origin Feat&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;You gain the following benefits.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Instrument Training.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; You gain proficiency with three Musical Instruments of your choice.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
